    "measurementTechnique": [
      "The Codes used to generate UT-GLOBUS data along with detailed instructions can be found in the GitHub repository: https://github.com/texuslabut/UT-GLOBUS",
      "Building footprints are obtained from OpenStreetMaps (OSM), Microsoft building footprints or the generative building feature estimation (GBFE).",
      "Process spaceborne altimetry (ICESat-2 and GEDI) and Advanced land observation satellite (ALOS) elevation datasets.",
      "Using airborne LiDAR derived building heights as target, train the random forest model to predict the building heights using spaceborne and population density data as predictors. Compile an independent testing dataset and validate the predicted building heights.",
      "Calculate the urban canopy parameters needed by the multi-layer urban model in WRF."
